doc:Factsarticle_1_11 schema:abstract "Proton exchange membrane fuel cell fault diagnosis faces limitations because conventional offline methods lack real-time predictive capability and existing prediction approaches are confined to single fault types. The study proposes an online multi-fault prediction framework using sensor fusion, a real-time sliding window, and a modified CNN-based Bi-LSTM parallel model with attention mechanism."@en .
